flowchart TD
    C[Lifecycle command] --> H[Run handler]
    H --> N[Build names-only record]
    N --> L{Lock acquired?}
    L -->|yes| R[Rotate if needed]
    L -->|deadline| A[Append without rotation]
    R --> W[One bounded append]
    A --> W
    W --> E[Return handler result]
    N -. recording failure .-> E
    W -. write failure .-> E
